bove or below the season's mean in proportion to the other league's clubs; within its league a club stands (W% − ½ − f × Δ) ÷ ((1 − f) × n/(n − 1) + f) above its league's mean, f the share of its league's games that were interleague and n the clubs of its league; m 0.0246, the win share a point of strength is worth in the engine under 2004's rules. Every player of the club moves by one whole number and the best few of its lineup by one more, so nobody passes a teammate.","licence":"WAR: JEFFBAGWELL (Neil Paine), MIT. Names, birthplaces, clubs and ballparks: the Baseball Databank (Chadwick Baseball Bureau), CC BY-SA 3.0; its home games from Retrosheet. See public/baseball/ATTRIBUTION.txt.","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Neil-Paine-1/MLB-WAR-data-historical/1c8c3084d62112efdaa7054125af3cd01003e38d/jeffbagwell_war_historical_2025.csv","retrieved":"2026-11-10","rawScale":"WAR"},"map":"mlb2004","nations":{"124":[73,18,[["Cody McKay","C/3B",66],["Justin Morneau","1B",72],["Corey Koskie","3B",85],["Jason Bay","LF/CF",77],["Aaron Guiel","LF/RF",69],["Simon Pond","LF/RF",60],["Larry Walker","RF",89],["Matt Stairs","RF/1B/LF",71],["Rich Harden","SP",81],["Erik Bedard","SP",70],["Ryan Dempster","SP",68],["Jeff Francis","SP",67],["Shawn Hill","SP",57],["Eric Gagne","RP",92],["Paul Quantrill","RP",78],["Rheal Cormier","RP",78],["Jesse Crain","RP",68],["Aaron Myette","RP",63]]],"158":[48,2,[["Chin-Feng Chen","LF",64],["Chin-hui Tsao","SP",66]]],"170":[52,3,[["Jolbert Cabrera","3B/1B/2B/SS/LF/CF/RF",69],["Edgar Renteria","SS",85],["Orlando Cabrera","SS",76]]],"192":[61,12,[["Rafael Palmeiro","1B",77],["Rey Ordonez","SS",69],["Eli Marrero","LF/C/1B/CF/RF",79],["Alex Sanchez","CF/LF",72],["Orlando Hernandez","SP",85],["Livan Hernandez","SP",83],["Jose Contreras","SP",72],["Danys Baez","RP",78],["Michael Tejera","RP",71],["Vladimir Nunez","RP",70],["Eddie Oropesa","RP",62],["Adrian Hernandez","RP",60]]],"214":[86,26,[["Miguel Olivo","C",71],["Alberto Castillo","C",66],["Alb